# Third-party apps kept locally for interoperability analysis. Never commit them: they are other
# companies' copyrighted software (APKMirror bundles are .apkm/.xapk, which *.apk above misses),
# and redistributing them from a public repository is the one clearly unlawful step in that work.
# See docs/streaming-app-interop.md.
rea-apps/
